cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CanProTarget, please cite the software archive below."
title: "CanProTarget"
abstract: >-
  A residue-resolved prioritization platform for covalent cancer drug
  discovery. CanProTarget integrates cancer gene dependencies, small-molecule
  covalent ligand engagement measured by chemoproteomics, and base-editing
  evidence for individual cysteines, keeping each layer at the resolution it
  is measured at.
type: software
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/Bertoldo-Lab/CanProTarget"
url: "https://bertoldolab.shinyapps.io/CanProTarget/"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-17"
# doi: 10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX   # uncomment once Zenodo reserves the DOI
keywords:
  - covalent inhibitors
  - chemoproteomics
  - cancer dependencies
  - cysteine ligandability
  - target prioritization
